- <app>.conf must match the value passed with --app.
- SERVICE_TYPE supports: systemd, service.
- CATALINA_HOME is required in service mode.
- In systemd mode, CATALINA_HOME is discovered from the unit.
- TOMCAT_LINK is optional:
    if omitted -> ${TOMCAT_ROOT}/latest<major>
    if defined -> exact configured symlink is used.
- CATALINA_HOME and CATALINA_BASE must be different.
- For shared Tomcat:
    ALLOW_SHARED_LINK="true"
    SHARED_APPS must be identical and in the same order in every member config.
- SHARED_APPS order controls startup and validation order.
- STARTUP_DELAY may be different for each application.
